# Local development variables. Copy to `.dev.vars`, which is gitignored:
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# `wrangler dev` reads .dev.vars; the vitest Workers pool binds its own value in
# packages/api/vitest.config.ts. Production does NOT use this file — the real key
# is a Cloudflare secret:
#
#   wrangler secret put TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY
#
# Signs the HS256 session JWT (architecture.md §0.2). The value below is a
# throwaway for local use and CI; it is deliberately not a secret.
TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY=local-dev-signing-key-not-secret
